		"Names the World of Warcraft: Forever client showed players in this language, read by `forge data names` (rust/crates/forge-data/src/names_sources.rs, load_observed_names) right after the client's own tables and before the web quest database, DingDB and pfQuest: the server's own name is the true one.",
